      ],
      "summary_en": "Thrusts forward, damaging all enemies in a line. On hit, grants a stack of Gathering Storm for a few seconds. At 2 stacks, Mortal Steel dashes Yone forward with a gust of wind knocking enemies Airborne.",
      "summary_zh": "向前出剑，呈直线造成伤害。 在命中时，错玉切会获得一层旋风烈斩效果，持续数秒。在2层时，错玉切会使永恩向前冲刺并带着一阵能够击飞敌人的旋风。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1451033:4032640"
      ]
