      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Cleaves forward, damaging all enemies in a cone. Grants a shield to Yone, the value is increased by the number of champions hit by the swipe. Spirit Cleave's cooldown and cast time scale with attack speed.",
      "summary_zh": "向前顺劈，对锥形范围内的所有敌人造成伤害。为永恩提供一个护盾，护盾生命值会基于被顺劈到的敌方英雄的数量而得到提升。 凛神斩的冷却时间和施放时间可通过攻击速度来缩短。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1451035:4032641"
      ]
